<title>HUNGARY: Hungary 1-mo BUBOR rate 21.54 pct, 3-mo 21.38 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary 1-mo BUBOR rate 21.54 pct, 3-mo 21.38 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Budapest Interbank Offered Rates (BUBOR) remained steady at 21.54 percent for the one-month maturity and edged up to 21.38 percent from 21.37 percent for the three-month maturity, the National Bank of Hungary (NBH) said.</p>
<p>-- Budapest Newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
